"Oh ho, I never expected to run into you so suddenly.{w}But tell me, how do you differ from the five primal races?
What was this changing of generations even for!"{w}{p}"Come, let us have a little bout, shall we?{w}This power of the Ryug I have heard such rumors of --
show it to me!!"{w}

"We are searching for the Celestial Readings
on our end as well, but..."{w}{p}"This is exactly what the Star Capital exists for,
and yet we have been of no help. I am ashamed."{w}

"Don't go underestimatin'
what us ogres can build, now."{w}{p}"Long as we got the blueprints and the tools,
we'll whip it up in no time, drinkin' and snackin' the whole while!"{w}

{0E}"If you need logistics or funding,
come talk to Barjeff and Teridon, won't you?{0F}
Let's make it a deal: one hug for each favor!"{w}

"So, what did you think?{w}The other nations are all working hard
to save the land in their own ways."{w}{p}"If you can help them, don't stop at Algrantz --
lend the other nations a hand too, okay?"{w}

